==Icelandic==
===Etymology===
Old Norse.

===Verb===
'''ríða''' (+ {{dat}})

# to [[ride]] (esp. on [[horseback]])
#: ''[[ekki#Icelandic|Ekki]] '''ríða''' [[hestur#Icelandic|hestinum]] [[minn#Icelandic|mínum]].''
#:: Don't '''ride''' my [[horse]].
# {{vulgar|lang=is}} to [[fuck]], to [[screw]]
#: ''[[langa#Icelandic|Langar]] [[þú#Icelandic|þig]] að '''ríða'''?''
#:: Do you [[want]] to '''fuck'''?
#: '''''Ríddu''' [[ég|mér]].''
#:: '''Fuck''' [[I|me]].

====Derived terms====
*[[ríða að fullu]] ("[[exhaust]]")
*[[ríða burtreið]] ("[[tilt]]", "[[joust]]")
